{"name": "Composition Test Unlocked", "mod_id": "tfm2_comptest_unlock", "author": "tfm2mods", "version": "0.6.0", "description": "Removes the Composition Test limits and runs several test matches at once.\n\n* No daily limit and no stamina cost.\n* The same player can fill more than one slot; 5 vs 5 needs only 5 players on your roster.\n* One Start Test runs 1-10 matches at the same time (- / + selector), each with a different seed. Every result is saved to History.\n* Live scoreboard while the matches run.\n* History filter: Latest Results (your last run) or All Results, with the Blue : Red win count.\n\nSettings: comptest_items.cfg in the mod folder - runs = matches per Start Test (1-10, default 5), parallel = 1 all at once / 0 one after another. Restart the game after editing.\n\nBuilt for game 0.7.3. The mod patches the game's own code, so it is rebuilt for each game update; on any other game version the game disables it. Code mod (native DLL, Windows only). Korean when the game is set to Korean, English otherwise.", "last_updated": "2026-11-18", "dependencies": [{"mod_id": "base", "version": ">=0.7.3, <0.7.4"}]}